/F1 11 Tf
(A linear equation has one variable raised to power one.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Strategy: isolate the variable using inverse operations,) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(keeping the equation balanced on both sides.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Example: solve 3x + 7 = 22.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(3x = 22 - 7) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(3x = 15) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(x = 5) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf
(Check: 3\(5\) + 7 = 15 + 7 = 22.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
